{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02890","headline":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降 · 郭正一","name":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂宫初服冕，兰掖早升筓。\n礼盛亲迎晋，声芬出降齐。\n金龟开瑞钮，宝翟上仙袿。\n转扇承宵月，扬旌照夕蜺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郭正一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02890.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02890","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗镜》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鏡_(四庫全書本)）"}